~ condition_worsened
# reading diary
Danilo: Mateo... Diyos ko... lahat pala  'to tinago mo samin...
# chapel darken, soundfx
Danilo: Akala ko... Masaya ka... na wala kang dinadala...
Danilo: Hindi ko alam... tinatago mo pala lahat ng 'yon sa likod ng tawa mo...
Danilo: Pero pinabayaan kita.
Danilo: Mateo... Sorry...
# ghost appears
do _candle_dim()
do ghost_appears.emit("restless")
=> END

~ resltess_ghost_appeared
Entity: ...Danilo... bakit... mo ako iniwan...?
Danilo: Mateo... ikaw ba ‘yan?
Danilo: [shake]Hindi... mali ‘to...[/shake]
Entity: Nangako ka... na hindi mo ako iiwan...
Danilo: [shake]Hindi ko ginawa ‘yon... hinanap kita kahit saan![/shake]
Entity: Kasinungalingan... [wave freq=10 amp=20]Nakalimutan mo ako...[/wave]
do show_distortion()
Danilo: [shake]Hindi! Hinding-hindi kita nakalimutan![/shake]
Entity: [shake rate=25 level=15]Kung ganon... bakit ako namatay mag-isa?![/shake]
#=> END
#
#~ restless_ghost_turn_and_walk_a_bit
do _candle_dimmer()
do mateo_turn("restless")
Entity: Halika... dito... Danilo... dito ka...
do mateo_walk_down("restless")
=> END

~ restless_cliff
# transition outside / cliff
# Shadow stands near edge
Danilo: Mateo... tama na, please...
Entity: ...
# Look down
do _ghost_down("restless")
Entity: ...
Danilo: Sandali lang...
Entity: ...
Danilo: [shake]Ayokong mawala ka ulit.[/shake]
Entity: [shake rate=30 level=20][color=#ff5555]INIWAN MO AKO![/color][/shake]
# Look left
do _ghost_left("restless")
Entity: Hinihintay ka ng hangin, Danilo.
Danilo: Sandali lang... pakiusap...
Entity: Panahon mo nang mahulog.
Danilo: Huwag mo akong iwan... Mateo!
Entity: [fade]...[/fade]
Entity: [shake rate=30 level=20][color=#ff5555]Sumama ka sa akin.[/color][/shake]
Danilo: [wave freq=5 amp=10][i]Patawad... patawad talaga...[/i][/wave]
do _ghost_vanish("restless")
do _go_to_next_scene()
# Shadow fades to nothing
# Danilo collapses at the edge. The voices scream louder, swallowing him in darkness.
=> END